WEBVTT

00:00:12.580 --> 00:00:16.950
Hatena, the master thief,
is off to collect her prize.

00:00:30.370 --> 00:00:33.450
<i>Tell me, do you remember?</i>

00:00:33.450 --> 00:00:37.370
<i>Yes, the wondrous God-given power you have,</i>

00:00:37.370 --> 00:00:43.200
<i>like sleight of hand without any tricks?</i>

00:00:43.200 --> 00:00:47.000
<i>Tell me, have you already forgotten?</i>

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:50.160
<i>Those dreamlike, heart-shaped</i>

00:00:50.160 --> 00:00:55.540
<i>flower-bouquet-like words of yours?</i>

00:00:55.540 --> 00:01:01.790
<i>I'm sure, I'm sure</i>

00:01:01.790 --> 00:01:05.410
<i>this key will open your treasure box</i>

00:01:05.410 --> 00:01:11.700
<i>and let you remember them tonight</i>

00:01:11.700 --> 00:01:14.580
<i>Farewell!</i>

00:01:14.580 --> 00:01:15.870
<i>Watch me now,</i>

00:01:15.870 --> 00:01:19.080
<i>I'm gently, quietly going to disappear,</i>

00:01:19.080 --> 00:01:21.000
<i>so find me</i>

00:01:21.000 --> 00:01:22.200
<i>I'm over here</i>

00:01:22.200 --> 00:01:27.330
<i>Our long, long night of secrets is beginning</i>

00:01:27.330 --> 00:01:28.620
<i>Come after me</i>

00:01:28.620 --> 00:01:33.790
<i>Once you see the twinkle of my tearstains,</i>

00:01:33.790 --> 00:01:36.660
<i>catch me with your voice</i>

00:01:36.660 --> 00:01:41.370
<i>and the magic words only the two of us know</i>

00:01:59.870 --> 00:02:03.950
Nice and easy... Nice and easy...

00:02:05.540 --> 00:02:08.830
Hey, Muff-<i>kun</i>, my feet can't reach the floor.

00:02:09.910 --> 00:02:12.660
Is that... a burglar?

00:02:15.000 --> 00:02:17.410
Muff-<i>kun</i>, if you please?

00:02:21.790 --> 00:02:23.040
Thank you.

00:02:23.040 --> 00:02:25.580
What... is that?

00:02:25.580 --> 00:02:27.700
Ah, hold on...

00:02:30.950 --> 00:02:33.660
Muff-<i>kun</i>, what's the matter? Stop pulling on me!

00:02:33.660 --> 00:02:36.750
You burglar! Hold it!

00:02:36.750 --> 00:02:37.910
You're not getting away!

00:02:37.910 --> 00:02:40.540
W-Watch your hands!

00:02:44.500 --> 00:02:47.410
You failed, all right.

00:02:50.080 --> 00:02:52.290
I anticipated as much.

00:02:52.290 --> 00:02:54.700
I tried to stop her.

00:02:54.700 --> 00:02:59.410
U-Um... I...

00:02:59.410 --> 00:03:00.500
Hatena?

00:03:00.500 --> 00:03:03.330
Goodness, how bold of you.

00:03:03.330 --> 00:03:07.410
Stealing a gentleman's heart
requires some first-class moves.

00:03:11.450 --> 00:03:13.790
Big sister means business.

00:03:13.790 --> 00:03:16.870
My word, what a disaster.

00:03:16.870 --> 00:03:19.540
I cannot believe you raised such a commotion.

00:03:19.540 --> 00:03:23.370
Jeeves-<i>san</i>, I am partially to blame, as well.

00:03:23.370 --> 00:03:25.120
I'm sorry.

00:03:26.410 --> 00:03:28.660
Why were you breaking in like a burglar?

00:03:28.660 --> 00:03:32.120
I-I am not a burglar! I'm a master thief!

00:03:32.120 --> 00:03:38.500
Um... I have no idea what's going on here.
Would you mind explaining?

00:03:39.500 --> 00:03:41.870
I see no way around it.

00:03:41.870 --> 00:03:46.120
However, once you hear what we tell you,
there will be no going back.

00:03:46.120 --> 00:03:50.450
If you are all right with that,
we will tell you.

00:03:50.450 --> 00:03:53.750
Those of us in the Hoshisato
family have a secret.

00:04:01.000 --> 00:04:03.200
This is an Artifact.

00:04:05.040 --> 00:04:07.500
A magic item that Mama created.

00:04:07.500 --> 00:04:08.790
Huh?

00:04:08.790 --> 00:04:11.830
Y-You're kidding me. Magic?

00:04:11.830 --> 00:04:14.830
Artifacts have a mysterious power.

00:04:14.830 --> 00:04:19.370
Each one has a different power,
and each one is one of a kind.

00:04:19.370 --> 00:04:22.660
The technique to create Artifacts
was passed down through Mama's family,

00:04:22.660 --> 00:04:25.830
and she is the one and only
successor to inherit the skill.

00:04:25.830 --> 00:04:29.500
Maeve-<i>san </i>is a successor?

00:04:29.500 --> 00:04:33.660
The family has kept the technique
for making Artifacts a secret,

00:04:33.660 --> 00:04:37.000
but at some point, a great
deal of Artifacts were stolen,

00:04:37.000 --> 00:04:40.160
and became scattered around the world.

00:04:40.160 --> 00:04:43.580
Once they did, a number
of people of influence and wealth

00:04:43.580 --> 00:04:46.500
came to learn of the existence of Artifacts.

00:04:46.500 --> 00:04:50.910
Among them were those who turned up
offering great sums of money

00:04:50.910 --> 00:04:54.200
to have the family create
Artifacts that benefitted them.

00:04:54.200 --> 00:04:59.910
Mama opposed the idea, but she couldn't
go against the will of the family.

00:04:59.910 --> 00:05:05.620
So she slipped away from the family
and fled to Japan with Papa.

00:05:06.660 --> 00:05:10.500
But Mama decided that alone wasn't enough.

00:05:10.500 --> 00:05:12.870
She couldn't stand by and do nothing

00:05:12.870 --> 00:05:17.500
while Artifacts were being used
to hurt people and commit crimes.

00:05:17.500 --> 00:05:21.830
That's why Mama became Maeve the master thief.

00:05:21.830 --> 00:05:28.620
Master thief? But that's the same...
as a burglar, right?

00:05:28.620 --> 00:05:34.370
No! She's a master thief!
When Mama takes back an Artifact,

00:05:34.370 --> 00:05:38.660
she makes sure to replace it with
an identical item that isn't magic.

00:05:38.660 --> 00:05:42.290
So most people don't even
notice it has been stolen.

00:05:43.290 --> 00:05:44.580
Watch this.

00:05:46.830 --> 00:05:50.830
I want to give Mama-- to give Mother a hand.

00:05:50.830 --> 00:05:56.500
So I, um, dressed up like this...

00:05:56.500 --> 00:05:58.500
And that's why!

00:05:58.500 --> 00:06:03.040
Okay. So why did you come into my room?

00:06:03.040 --> 00:06:04.450
W-Well...

00:06:04.450 --> 00:06:06.370
I apologize, Makoto-<i>sama</i>.

00:06:06.370 --> 00:06:10.120
The mistress said that she wanted
to practice her master thievery,

00:06:10.120 --> 00:06:16.040
so I urged her to use you
as her target. Please forgive me.

00:06:16.040 --> 00:06:18.410
Huh? Um...

00:06:18.410 --> 00:06:23.250
This is the Hoshisato family secret.
Father is the only magician;

00:06:23.250 --> 00:06:26.120
Mother is a mage and master thief.

00:06:26.120 --> 00:06:29.620
And I am a master-thief-in-training.

00:06:29.620 --> 00:06:33.580
Makoto, you'll keep that a secret, won't you?

00:06:33.580 --> 00:06:36.450
Mm-hmm, I promise.

00:06:36.450 --> 00:06:41.330
Revealing a secret is a magician's
greatest taboo, after all.

00:06:41.330 --> 00:06:42.910
Makoto...

00:06:46.950 --> 00:06:48.000
Well then,

00:06:48.000 --> 00:06:53.950
it is quite late.
Why doesn't everyone get to bed?

00:06:55.370 --> 00:06:58.200
Oh, you certainly do look sharp.

00:06:58.200 --> 00:06:59.290
Aw, shucks.

00:06:59.290 --> 00:07:03.620
You probably do not know
where your new school is.

00:07:03.620 --> 00:07:06.000
I will drive you there today.

00:07:06.000 --> 00:07:09.870
Oh, no, that's okay. I can go with Hatena.

00:07:09.870 --> 00:07:11.370
No, you can't.

00:07:13.290 --> 00:07:15.370
Wow...

00:07:15.370 --> 00:07:17.700
What are you staring at?

00:07:17.700 --> 00:07:20.000
I was just thinking you
look nice in your uniform.

00:07:20.000 --> 00:07:22.410
Wha--? S-Say what you will,

00:07:22.410 --> 00:07:24.910
you still can't come to school with me.

00:07:24.910 --> 00:07:27.620
Also, don't speak to me while we're at school.

00:07:27.620 --> 00:07:28.500
Why not?

00:07:28.500 --> 00:07:31.250
W-We don't need any funny rumors
getting started, do we?

00:07:31.250 --> 00:07:35.040
A-All right. But for today,
you can at least walk me there,

00:07:35.040 --> 00:07:36.250
since I don't know the way--

00:07:36.250 --> 00:07:38.290
I said no!

00:07:38.290 --> 00:07:40.370
Aw...

00:07:40.370 --> 00:07:42.580
Safe journey.

00:07:43.660 --> 00:07:47.750
Oh, my. Well, would you like to go with me?

00:07:49.120 --> 00:07:51.790
Huh? You mean, you, too, Ema-<i>san</i>?

00:07:51.790 --> 00:07:57.660
Yes. I am two grades above her,
but I go to the same school as Mistress Kana.

00:07:57.660 --> 00:08:03.250
And starting today,
the same school as you. Here's to a good year.

00:08:03.250 --> 00:08:08.200
Next up, we will hear from
Sakurai Ema, student council member,

00:08:08.200 --> 00:08:13.290
representing currently enrolled students,
welcoming the incoming class.

00:08:13.290 --> 00:08:15.830
Ema-<i>sama </i>always looks so beautiful.

00:08:15.830 --> 00:08:18.160
Ah, she's so enchanting!

00:08:18.160 --> 00:08:24.040
Ema-<i>san </i>is so popular. It's been one
surprise after another since yesterday.

00:08:33.540 --> 00:08:35.160
Good grief.

00:08:36.160 --> 00:08:39.830
Why are there so many girls at this school?

00:08:39.830 --> 00:08:42.750
This was an all-girls school up until last year.

00:08:42.750 --> 00:08:47.200
I was thinking that if I came
to this school, I could chat them up.

00:08:47.200 --> 00:08:50.330
And now, today, that time has finally arrived!

00:08:50.330 --> 00:08:53.040
I'm Sakagami Tokichiro. And you are?

00:08:53.040 --> 00:08:55.790
I'm Shiranui Makoto. Nice to meet you.

00:08:55.790 --> 00:08:59.870
Ho, so you're the Shiranui
Makoto-<i>kun </i>I've heard about.

00:08:59.870 --> 00:09:01.370
People are talking about me?

00:09:01.370 --> 00:09:02.830
No, not especially.

00:09:02.830 --> 00:09:06.080
This is Hayashida. He may seem
like an intellectual character

00:09:06.080 --> 00:09:10.080
and sound like he's profound by saying,
"What's that?" and "It can't be,"

00:09:10.080 --> 00:09:11.750
but there's no real meaning behind it.

00:09:11.750 --> 00:09:15.330
I wonder if you would let me
into your little circle, too?

00:09:16.660 --> 00:09:20.040
I'm Matsuo. Nice to meet you.

00:09:20.040 --> 00:09:23.660
How can I put this?
What imposing figures they are.

00:09:23.660 --> 00:09:24.660
Hatena!

00:09:24.660 --> 00:09:26.540
We're in the same class again!

00:09:26.540 --> 00:09:31.580
K-Kokomi! I mean, good day, Kikyouin-<i>san</i>.

00:09:31.580 --> 00:09:33.830
Incidentally, whoever do you
mean when you say "Hatena"?

00:09:33.830 --> 00:09:35.450
But you <i>are </i>Hatena.

00:09:35.450 --> 00:09:39.580
You can try to play it off,
but the truth will come out soon enough.

00:09:39.580 --> 00:09:43.330
Kikyouin-<i>san</i>, you are so funny.
I don't know what you mean.

00:09:43.330 --> 00:09:47.580
What do you mean? Hatena, you're Hatena!

00:09:47.580 --> 00:09:53.830
"Ka"... "Na"... is how it's written,
but it's read "Hatena"!

00:09:53.830 --> 00:09:57.700
You've gone by that name ever since
you were little, haven't you?!

00:09:57.700 --> 00:10:01.410
Hey, stop calling me by my little baby nickname!

00:10:02.410 --> 00:10:05.080
Looks like everyone knows now.

00:10:10.080 --> 00:10:14.700
Kokomi, you dumb, dumb, dumb, dumb,
dumb, dumb, dumb, dumb, dumb dummy!

00:10:14.700 --> 00:10:19.250
I wanted to start middle school
with a more ladylike persona!

00:10:20.250 --> 00:10:21.620
Here you are.

00:10:21.620 --> 00:10:22.790
Are you still here?

00:10:22.790 --> 00:10:25.830
I was killing time here because
I don't want to go home with you.

00:10:25.830 --> 00:10:29.660
I was planning on going right home, too,
but then Ema-<i>san </i>told me...

00:10:29.660 --> 00:10:34.830
She acts tough, but the mistress
actually gets lonesome quite easily.

00:10:34.830 --> 00:10:40.120
Mamoru-<i>sama </i>and Maeve-<i>sama </i>had
to work during her entrance ceremony,

00:10:40.120 --> 00:10:44.330
so please go home with her,
so she does not feel too lonely.

00:10:44.330 --> 00:10:47.500
This is part of your duty
as a butler-in-training.

00:10:47.500 --> 00:10:51.540
Jeez, Ema-<i>san </i>is such a busybody.

00:10:51.540 --> 00:10:54.250
Listen, if you don't want to go home together,

00:10:54.250 --> 00:10:56.200
would you like to talk for a bit right now?

00:10:56.200 --> 00:10:59.790
S-Sure, but just for a bit, really.

00:10:59.790 --> 00:11:01.580
Mm-hmm.

00:11:01.580 --> 00:11:04.910
About those Artifacts
you mentioned last night...

00:11:04.910 --> 00:11:08.750
The magic and master thief
part just doesn't seem real.

00:11:08.750 --> 00:11:12.120
We weren't lying about that.
Come on out, Muff-<i>kun</i>.

00:11:13.500 --> 00:11:20.000
Muff-<i>kun </i>here is a special Artifact
that Mother made for me.

00:11:20.000 --> 00:11:23.120
My do-anything wings that keep me protected.

00:11:23.120 --> 00:11:25.870
Looking at it like this, it's amazing.

00:11:25.870 --> 00:11:28.410
I can't believe Maeve-<i>san</i>
made something like that.

00:11:28.410 --> 00:11:36.160
Mm-hmm. Mother is incredible.
Beautiful, kind, and Father's partner.

00:11:36.160 --> 00:11:39.290
Not to mention being a mage and a master thief.

00:11:39.290 --> 00:11:43.040
She's an amazing person, not at all like me.

00:11:44.040 --> 00:11:49.500
Even now, she's off somewhere
trying hard to recover an Artifact.

00:11:51.000 --> 00:11:54.540
Makoto, how much do you remember about Mother?

00:11:54.540 --> 00:12:00.790
She's blond, and pretty, and very nice.
She's Master's assistant...

00:12:00.790 --> 00:12:02.040
Is that all?

00:12:02.040 --> 00:12:08.500
Mm-hmm. Sorry. I only knew her when
I was little, so I don't remember much.

00:12:08.500 --> 00:12:10.120
Yeah.

00:12:12.040 --> 00:12:13.660
Oh, my...

00:12:16.290 --> 00:12:18.290
What was that yellow thing just now?

00:12:18.290 --> 00:12:21.500
Hoshisato-<i>san</i>, could we see it again?

00:12:21.500 --> 00:12:25.830
U-Um, wh-why, whatever do you mean?

00:12:27.620 --> 00:12:32.120
That was amazing, Hatena.
When did you master a trick like that?

00:12:32.120 --> 00:12:34.580
Huh? Oh, I, uh...

00:12:34.580 --> 00:12:36.290
I was the one who did that.

00:12:36.290 --> 00:12:38.450
--Oh!
--Is that right?

00:12:38.450 --> 00:12:42.160
I'm learning magic from Hoshisato<i>-san</i>'s father,

00:12:42.160 --> 00:12:44.200
so she was letting me practice.

00:12:44.200 --> 00:12:45.540
Come to think of it...

00:12:45.540 --> 00:12:49.200
Hoshisato-<i>san</i>'s father is
a famous magician, isn't he?

00:12:49.200 --> 00:12:53.080
I'm still just an apprentice,
but I can do this much.

00:12:57.080 --> 00:12:58.330
Ha!

00:13:04.370 --> 00:13:06.950
--Incredible!
--How pretty! That was great!

00:13:06.950 --> 00:13:10.790
It sure was! Surprising, huh?

00:13:10.790 --> 00:13:14.120
Hatena, you owe me.

00:13:17.750 --> 00:13:19.250
Now then...

00:13:21.120 --> 00:13:24.200
I have to do well with my
butler-in-training work, too.

00:13:24.200 --> 00:13:29.370
Hmm, there is nothing in particular
that I need your help with.

00:13:29.370 --> 00:13:32.580
There is still some time
until dinner needs to be prepared.

00:13:32.580 --> 00:13:35.830
Makoto-<i>sama</i>, you are probably
worn out from your entrance ceremony.

00:13:35.830 --> 00:13:38.830
Why don't you get some rest?

00:13:38.830 --> 00:13:42.000
I don't have anything to do at the moment.

00:13:42.000 --> 00:13:44.040
Makoto-<i>niisama</i>...

00:13:47.160 --> 00:13:48.870
Yumemi-<i>chan</i>?

00:13:48.870 --> 00:13:52.250
Um, can I come in?

00:13:53.330 --> 00:13:55.330
Pardon the intrus--

00:13:59.040 --> 00:14:01.870
That's a pretty big stuffed animal.
Is it a bear?

00:14:01.870 --> 00:14:04.870
Yeah. I got Gaugau here from Mama.

00:14:04.870 --> 00:14:06.870
Nice to meet you, Gaugau-<i>kun</i>.

00:14:06.870 --> 00:14:08.790
Gaugau is a girl.

00:14:08.790 --> 00:14:12.200
A girl? Named Gaugau?

00:14:12.200 --> 00:14:13.410
Huh?

00:14:15.370 --> 00:14:17.080
What is that mark?

00:14:17.080 --> 00:14:19.370
That's Mother's symbol.

00:14:19.370 --> 00:14:20.830
Maeve-<i>san</i>'s?

00:14:20.830 --> 00:14:21.700
Yeah.

00:14:21.700 --> 00:14:25.200
When is Maeve-<i>san </i>coming home?

00:14:25.200 --> 00:14:27.080
I don't know.

00:14:35.410 --> 00:14:37.660
Um, should I go call them--

00:14:37.660 --> 00:14:39.290
--Makoto!
--Y-Yes?

00:14:39.290 --> 00:14:42.410
Listen, you have to leave, right now!

00:14:42.410 --> 00:14:44.410
H-Huh?!

00:14:44.410 --> 00:14:45.950
Save your breath!

00:14:45.950 --> 00:14:49.040
--H-Hold on a second, Hate--
--There's no time!

00:14:49.040 --> 00:14:51.950
For now, just get the minimum amount
of your things you can take!

00:14:51.950 --> 00:14:52.790
Hurry!

00:14:52.790 --> 00:14:54.830
Mistress Kana, you are overreacting.

00:14:54.830 --> 00:14:58.870
There's no time!
We have to hurry while we still can!

00:15:04.870 --> 00:15:06.910
U-Um...

00:15:08.250 --> 00:15:12.250
Mistress, if you could explain a bit further?

00:15:19.700 --> 00:15:25.200
Mistress Kana,
Kikyouin Kokomi-<i>sama </i>is here to see you.

00:15:25.200 --> 00:15:26.540
She's already here?!

00:15:26.540 --> 00:15:30.120
She told me that she has an
appointment with you, Mistress Kana.

00:15:30.120 --> 00:15:33.040
She is waiting for you in the parlor.

00:15:33.040 --> 00:15:36.410
What do we do?
If she finds out that you're here...

00:15:36.410 --> 00:15:38.830
Oh, so that's why you wanted me to go.

00:15:38.830 --> 00:15:40.450
How can you be so calm?

00:15:40.450 --> 00:15:44.040
If word of us gets around the school,
I'll die of embarrassment!

00:15:44.040 --> 00:15:48.040
Okay, I'll just lock myself in my room.
I promise, I won't come out.

00:15:48.040 --> 00:15:53.370
That isn't good enough! When Kokomi
comes over, she always prowls around!

00:15:53.370 --> 00:15:55.750
This is why I didn't want her to come here!

00:15:55.750 --> 00:15:59.950
Ugh, it looks like this will be
another difficult mess to clean up.

00:15:59.950 --> 00:16:02.910
Hatena! Where are you?!

00:16:02.910 --> 00:16:07.370
Sheesh, you could at least
come out and greet me!

00:16:07.370 --> 00:16:12.580
A-A-At this point, Muff-<i>kun</i>,
use Guard Mode to hide Makoto!

00:16:14.450 --> 00:16:16.790
Whoa, what is this?! Hatena!

00:16:16.790 --> 00:16:19.830
Muff-<i>kun</i>'s Guard Mode is
an ironclad defensive mode.

00:16:19.830 --> 00:16:23.500
It becomes a seamless sphere,
protecting whoever is inside.

00:16:23.500 --> 00:16:29.580
You say that so confidently,
but this is huge and not hiding anything!

00:16:29.580 --> 00:16:33.870
It's all right. Any way you
look at it, it's just a largish ball.

00:16:33.870 --> 00:16:36.700
Yes, a perfectly unremarkable ball.

00:16:36.700 --> 00:16:37.540
Huh?!

00:16:37.540 --> 00:16:40.160
Hatena! Here's where you are!

00:16:40.160 --> 00:16:43.080
Kokomi! Don't come in here without asking!

00:16:43.080 --> 00:16:48.410
I apologize, Hoshisato-<i>sama</i>.
I tried to stop her, but she would not listen.

00:16:49.410 --> 00:16:50.620
What's this?

00:16:50.620 --> 00:16:54.950
This? Oh, um... A gift from Father.

00:16:54.950 --> 00:16:58.950
Oh, yeah? It seems strange for you
to leave it in your dining room, doesn't it?

00:16:58.950 --> 00:17:00.870
What is it used for?

00:17:00.870 --> 00:17:03.000
W-Well...

00:17:03.000 --> 00:17:04.790
It is a balancing ball.

00:17:04.790 --> 00:17:08.120
That's right! It's just a balancing ball.

00:17:08.120 --> 00:17:11.660
Ah! I've seen these in infomercials.

00:17:11.660 --> 00:17:13.080
Let's see...!

00:17:13.080 --> 00:17:14.950
Wh-What the--?

00:17:16.120 --> 00:17:18.370
It's pretty bouncy, huh?

00:17:20.080 --> 00:17:24.700
Huh? What was that? I just heard a strange yell.

00:17:24.700 --> 00:17:27.540
I wish I could see outside.

00:17:29.290 --> 00:17:33.160
I feel like my bottom hit something.

00:17:33.160 --> 00:17:35.950
Mistress Kokomi, please step aside.

00:17:35.950 --> 00:17:38.200
Muff-<i>kun</i>!

00:17:38.200 --> 00:17:41.000
As your bodyguard,
I will eliminate anything unsafe!

00:17:41.000 --> 00:17:43.750
It's not like that! I can explain!

00:17:45.000 --> 00:17:46.700
Move.

00:17:48.000 --> 00:17:51.540
My goodness, so this is where you're hiding,

00:17:51.540 --> 00:17:53.700
Shiranui Makoto-<i>kun</i>.

00:17:57.700 --> 00:18:01.080
Huh?! You already knew it all?!

00:18:01.080 --> 00:18:04.290
All Hoshisato family support requests

00:18:04.290 --> 00:18:06.620
come through the Kikyouin conglomerate.

00:18:06.620 --> 00:18:11.500
Naturally, we were the ones who handled
Shiranui-<i>kun</i>'s enrollment paperwork.

00:18:11.500 --> 00:18:15.500
But this is the first I've heard
of you being a butler-in-training.

00:18:15.500 --> 00:18:18.620
Well, that's a long story.

00:18:18.620 --> 00:18:21.160
Tough break for you, Shiranui-<i>kun</i>.

00:18:21.160 --> 00:18:24.540
You're supposed to be learning magic,
but now that you're stuck as a butler,

00:18:24.540 --> 00:18:27.540
you're forced to wash Hatena's underpants.

00:18:27.540 --> 00:18:29.950
There's no way I'd ever allow that!

00:18:29.950 --> 00:18:31.910
I'm kidding.

00:18:35.410 --> 00:18:38.120
Well, shall we get to the matter at hand?

00:18:38.120 --> 00:18:40.160
What matter?

00:18:40.160 --> 00:18:43.870
I'm here to collect on your debt to me.

00:18:43.870 --> 00:18:46.660
I knew it! You're here for <i>that</i>!

00:18:46.660 --> 00:18:47.660
For <i>what</i>?

00:18:47.660 --> 00:18:54.290
Of course I am. I'm going to go look
for my future Artifact right now!

00:18:54.290 --> 00:18:56.290
Ah! Kokomi!

00:18:57.580 --> 00:18:59.910
And so it begins.

00:18:59.910 --> 00:19:02.450
Excuse me, but what's going on here?

00:19:02.450 --> 00:19:07.790
When Mistress Kana received
her muffler Artifact from Maeve-<i>sama</i>,

00:19:07.790 --> 00:19:13.040
Mistress Kokomi became quite
envious and burst into tears.

00:19:13.040 --> 00:19:21.160
Mamoru-<i>sama </i>promised her that if
she could find an Artifact in the mansion

00:19:21.160 --> 00:19:25.620
and make it activate, he would give it to her.

00:19:25.620 --> 00:19:29.500
Are you sure about this? Artifacts are
supposed to be pretty important, right?

00:19:29.500 --> 00:19:31.790
First, she must distinguish the Artifact

00:19:31.790 --> 00:19:34.620
from the other items that are in the mansion.

00:19:34.620 --> 00:19:38.450
Then, she must guess the Artifact's true name,

00:19:38.450 --> 00:19:43.000
and make a contract with it,
or it will not activate for her.

00:19:43.000 --> 00:19:45.450
A true name and a contract?

00:19:45.450 --> 00:19:49.450
Well, Mamoru-<i>sama </i>must not
have anticipated it ever going that far

00:19:49.450 --> 00:19:52.330
when he made that promise.

00:19:52.330 --> 00:19:55.870
Mistress Kokomi has not
forgotten that promise ever since,

00:19:55.870 --> 00:20:00.330
and has visited from time to time
to conduct her search.

00:20:00.330 --> 00:20:03.370
Every time, she makes such a mess, too.

00:20:03.370 --> 00:20:07.330
An Artifact is something she wants that badly...

00:20:07.330 --> 00:20:12.250
Those who possess an Artifact
can obtain miracles.

00:20:12.250 --> 00:20:15.410
And if someone takes on
an Artifact that matches them,

00:20:15.410 --> 00:20:18.080
it is said that they can
make any dream come true.

00:20:20.410 --> 00:20:23.160
You sure do know a lot about Artifacts.

00:20:23.160 --> 00:20:27.540
Backing up the Hoshisato family
is one of the Kikyouin family's duties.

00:20:27.540 --> 00:20:32.370
I have done my general
homework into Artifacts, as well.

00:20:34.250 --> 00:20:37.120
Abracadabra! Eko Eko Azarak!

00:20:37.120 --> 00:20:40.370
It's not the devil! Come on, already!

00:20:40.370 --> 00:20:43.040
Hmm, this looks suspicious!

00:20:43.040 --> 00:20:46.660
It's a pretty, blue bookend, so...

00:20:46.660 --> 00:20:47.950
Blue End!

00:20:47.950 --> 00:20:50.370
Your true name is Blue End!

00:20:50.370 --> 00:20:51.370
No way.

00:20:51.370 --> 00:20:55.330
Blue End! Answer my call!

00:20:56.450 --> 00:20:58.000
Not this one either.

00:20:58.000 --> 00:21:00.290
Give it up already.

00:21:00.290 --> 00:21:04.620
Besides, a contract with
an Artifact requires a payment,

00:21:04.620 --> 00:21:06.540
and it isn't necessarily that good.

00:21:06.540 --> 00:21:09.160
I know that.

00:21:10.450 --> 00:21:13.910
As I recall, using yours raises
your temperature, doesn't it?

00:21:13.910 --> 00:21:19.620
Mm-hmm. So if I overuse it,
it's as hard on me as if I had a fever.

00:21:19.620 --> 00:21:22.370
Not this one either. Nor this one!

00:21:22.370 --> 00:21:25.540
Ah, I think I can feel
an aura coming from this one!

00:21:25.540 --> 00:21:27.330
Let's see, your true name is...

00:21:27.330 --> 00:21:30.410
Just stop already!

00:21:32.080 --> 00:21:33.580
See you, Hatena!

00:21:33.580 --> 00:21:35.750
You don't ever have to come back!

00:21:36.750 --> 00:21:39.040
I'll come visit you again!

00:21:40.040 --> 00:21:41.620
Oh, brother.

00:21:44.540 --> 00:21:49.120
Mistress Kokomi, it is too bad
you did not find your Artifact.

00:21:49.120 --> 00:21:52.080
Well, I'll have plenty of other chances.

00:21:52.080 --> 00:21:54.450
I can just go at it again next time.

00:21:54.450 --> 00:21:59.450
I see. There are plenty of chances.

00:22:02.330 --> 00:22:08.120
<i>My path now begins</i>

00:22:08.120 --> 00:22:16.500
<i>I've unleashed the hidden light of one future</i>

00:22:20.200 --> 00:22:22.870
<i>I've been on the hunt</i>

00:22:22.870 --> 00:22:26.910
<i>to find my furthest dreams</i>

00:22:26.910 --> 00:22:30.080
<i>I want to shine even brighter</i>

00:22:30.080 --> 00:22:35.160
<i>The "someday" that my former self prayed for</i>

00:22:35.160 --> 00:22:40.330
<i>is still far away, but I'll catch up</i>

00:22:40.330 --> 00:22:45.370
<i>"Miracle" is such an embarrassingly vague word</i>

00:22:45.370 --> 00:22:50.540
<i>My timeframe has neither forever nor a moment</i>

00:22:50.540 --> 00:22:57.790
<i>I move forward one step at a time to my voice</i>

00:22:57.790 --> 00:23:01.580
<i>No matter what awaits me</i>

00:23:01.580 --> 00:23:02.910
<i>beyond this pain</i>

00:23:02.910 --> 00:23:05.160
<i>I'll once again, yes once again</i>

00:23:05.160 --> 00:23:07.910
<i>leap up and shine</i>

00:23:07.910 --> 00:23:11.750
<i>Yeah, I'll put into words</i>

00:23:11.750 --> 00:23:13.290
<i>the view laid out before me</i>

00:23:13.290 --> 00:23:16.540
<i>and let it ring out dozens,</i>

00:23:16.540 --> 00:23:20.200
<i>even hundreds of times</i>

00:23:20.200 --> 00:23:24.500
<i>What color do you suppose love is?</i>

00:23:24.500 --> 00:23:30.200
<i>I've unleashed my hidden light</i>

00:23:32.000 --> 00:23:38.250
"What dream have you had recently?"

00:23:39.830 --> 00:23:51.870
"Mariah"

00:23:51.870 --> 00:24:01.790
"See you next time"
